      "Language": "pol",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Chosen aspects of the surgical-technique during shoulder arthroplasty were presented. In the description the most important stages of the implantation of shoulder prosthesis were taken into account. The necessity of the warnings during the surgical procedure of basic aspects of the anatomy and rules of shoulder biomechanics was pointed out. One underlined that an experience of the operator and correctly managed postoperative rehabilitation influence good final result of shoulder arthroplasty."},
